[0.1.2]
* Force PLAIN authentication for Cloudron's trusted internal SMTP relay; msmtp excludes cleartext methods from automatic selection when TLS is disabled.

[0.1.1]
* Pass the generated Cloudron msmtp configuration explicitly to sendmail.

[0.1.0]
* Initial Cloudron Community App package for Instatic 0.0.16.
* Use Cloudron-managed PostgreSQL and persistent storage under /app/data.
* Generate and persist INSTATIC_SECRET_KEY automatically.
* Add Cloudron sendmail transport for public form notifications.
* Add health checks, tests, release metadata, and operator documentation.
